  "_doc": "Bo loc Tuyet - cau hinh v1. Chinh bang web/snow-tuner.html roi bam Luu, dat file nay canh snow.exe. amount = luong tuyet (%, nhan so hat moi lop). vary = bien thien giua cac anh (+/- luong tuyet %, huong gio do, so bokeh %). seed 0 = moi anh mot bo hat rieng (theo ten file). camera: ong kinh AO de tinh do mo cua tuyet (met, mm). layers: lens = sat ong kinh, front = truoc mat mau, focus = quanh mau, behind = sau lung mau (bi nguoi che), far = xa trong phong. subject.mode: auto = tach nguoi tu dong (can models/modnet.onnx), neu khong chay duoc thi dung elip x/y/w/h (%); ellipse = luon dung elip; off = khong che. look: chinh mau SAU khi rac tuyet, cung bo cong cu voi Instax (enabled = bat/tat, strength = do dam); LUT .cube dat trong thu muc luts canh snow.exe.",
